biles\",\"industry_group\":\"Automobiles \\u0026 Components\",\"reporting_template\":\"Standard\",\"sector\":\"Consumer Discretionary\",\"sub_industry\":\"Automobile Manufacturers\",\"ticker\":\"TSLA\",\"topic_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/series-images-webp/KXTSLA.webp\"},\"last_updated_ts\":\"2026-10-14T16:28:51.36773Z\"}},\"events\":{\"CONTROLH-2026\":{\"id\":\"c4ff90c1-6e11-43b9-8f1e-6941e3c5364c\",\"ticker\":\"CONTROLH-2026\",\"series_ticker\":\"CONTROLH\",\"target_datetime\":\"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z\",\"mutually_exclusive\":true,\"mutually_exclusive_side\":\"yes\",\"collateral_return_type\":\"MECNET\",\"title\":\"Who will control the House?\",\"category\":\"Elections\",\"tags\":null,\"keywords\":null,\"min_tick_size\":\"\",\"settle_details\":\"This market may be determined early based on a consensus of media calls projecting control of the U.S. House. See full rules for details. Otherwise, victory will be determined by the party identification of the Speaker of the House on February 1, 2027.\",\"settlement_sources\":[{\"url\":\"https://www.congress.gov/\",\"name\":\"Library of Congress\"}],\"description_context\":\"\",\"underlying\":\"If the || Party || Party has won control of the || Chamber of Congress || in 2026, then the market resolves to Yes.\",\"metrics_tags\":null,\"mini_title\":\"Who will control the House?\",\"sub_title\":\"In 2026\",\"markets\":[],\"max_close_ts\":\"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z\",\"min_open_ts\":\"2024-11-06T15:00:00Z\",\"product_metadata\":{\"automatic_featured_text\":\"true\",\"competition\":\"House\",\"competition_scope\":\"Election\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://kalshi-public-docs.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/override_images/core/Election_Congress_Senate_House.webp\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{\"competition\":\"House\"},\"header_title\":\"Who will control the House?\",\"employment_collection_required\":false,\"exchange_shard\":0},\"CONTROLS-2026\":{\"id\":\"040e3492-6ba5-4b38-9dc6-88592ed7e533\",\"ticker\":\"CONTROLS-2026\",\"series_ticker\":\"CONTROLS\",\"target_datetime\":\"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z\",\"mutually_exclusive\":true,\"mutually_exclusive_side\":\"yes\",\"collateral_return_type\":\"MECNET\",\"title\":\"Who will control the Senate?\",\"category\":\"Elections\",\"tags\":null,\"keywords\":null,\"min_tick_size\":\"\",\"settle_details\":\"This market may be determined early based on a consensus of media calls projecting control of the U.S. Senate. See full rules for details. Otherwise, victory will be determined by the party identification of the President pro tempore of the Senate on February 1, 2027.\",\"settlement_sources\":[{\"url\":\"https://www.congress.gov/\",\"name\":\"Library of Congress\"}],\"description_context\":\"\",\"underlying\":\"If the || Party || Party has won control of the || Chamber of Congress || in 2026, then the market resolves to Yes.\",\"metrics_tags\":null,\"mini_title\":\"Who will control the Senate?\",\"sub_title\":\"In 2026\",\"markets\":[],\"max_close_ts\":\"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z\",\"min_open_ts\":\"2024-11-06T15:00:00Z\",\"product_metadata\":{\"automatic_featured_text\":\"true\",\"competition\":\"Senate\",\"competition_scope\":\"Election\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://kalshi-public-docs.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/override_images/core/Election_Congress_Senate_House.webp\",\"event_header_subtitle\":\"Settles on media consensus; if no consensus, President pro tempore's party on 2/1/27\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{\"competition\":\"Senate\",\"event_header_subtitle\":\"Settles on media consensus; if no consensus, President pro tempore's party on 2/1/27\"},\"header_title\":\"Who will control the Senate?\",\"employment_collection_required\":false,\"exchange_shard\":0},\"KXAISTREAMSERIES-27\":{\"id\":\"c1e812b5-7162-4b3a-bc4c-1d3023984216\",\"ticker\":\"KXAISTREAMSERIES-27\",\"series_ticker\":\"KXAISTREAMSERIES\",\"target_datetime\":\"2027-01-01T15:00:00Z\",\"mutually_exclusive\":false,\"collateral_return_type\":\"\",\"title\":\"Which companies will release a Fully AI-generated multi-episode scripted series  before 2027?\",\"category\":\"Financials\",\"tags\":null,\"keywords\":null,\"min_tick_size\":\"\",\"settle_details\":\" \",\"settlement_sources\":[{\"url\":\"https://www.netflix.com\",\"name\":\"Netflix\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.primevideo.com/\",\"name\":\"Amazon\"},{\"url\":\"https://disneyplus.com/\",\"name\":\"Disney+\"},{\"url\":\"https://tv.apple.com/\",\"name\":\"Apple\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.hbomax.com/\",\"name\":\"Max\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.hulu.com/\",\"name\":\"Hulu\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.paramountplus.com/home/\",\"name\":\"Paramount+\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.peacocktv.com/\",\"name\":\"Peacock\"}],\"description_context\":\"\",\"underlying\":\"If || Company || releases a || Product || to the public before || Date ||, then the market resolves to Yes.\",\"metrics_tags\":null,\"mini_title\":\"Which companies will release a Fully AI-generated multi-episode scripted series  before 2027?\",\"sub_title\":\"before 2027\",\"markets\":[],\"max_close_ts\":\"2027-01-01T04:59:00Z\",\"min_open_ts\":\"2025-07-25T14:00:00Z\",\"product_metadata\":{\"automatic_featured_text\":\"true\"},\"header_title\":\"Which companies will release a Fully AI-generated multi-episode scripted series  before 2027?\",\"employment_collection_required\":false,\"exchange_shard\":0},\"KXBALANCEPOWERCOMBO-27FEB\":{\"id\":\"8043a8cc-68ee-42f4-99e6-5480f8940fe4\",\"ticker\":\"KXBALANCEPOWERCOMBO-27FEB\",\"series_ticker\":\"KXBALANCEPOWERCOMBO\",\"target_datetime\":\"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z\",\"mutually_exclusive\":true,\"mutually_exclusive_side\":\"yes\",\"collateral_return_type\":\"MECNET\",\"title\":\"2026 Midterms: Congress Balance of Power?\",\"category\":\"Elections\",\"tags\":null,\"keywords\":null,\"min_tick_size\":\"\",\"settle_details\":\"This is a combination market requiring ALL specified outcomes to occur for the contract to pay out. If ANY single component resolves to No or becomes impossible, the entire contract immediately resolves to No. Each component is resolved according to its corresponding Kalshi ruleset: House Control uses CONTROL, Senate Control uses CONTROL. Each CONTROL component may resolve on an accelerated basis as outlined in the full rules.\",\"settlement_sources\":[{\"url\":\"https://www.congress.gov/\",\"name\":\"United States Congress\"}],\"description_context\":\"\",\"underlying\":\"If ALL of the following occur: ||outcomes||, then the market resolves to Yes.\",\"metrics_tags\":null,\"mini_title\":\"2026 Midterms: Congress Balance of Power?\",\"sub_title\":\"For Feb 2027\",\"markets\":[],\"max_close_ts\":\"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z\",\"min_open_ts\":\"2025-12-11T15:00:00Z\",\"product_metadata\":{\"competition\":\"US Elections\",\"competition_scope\":\"Balance of Power\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://kalshi-public-docs.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/override_images/core/Election_Republican_Democratic_Balance.webp\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{\"competition\":\"US Elections\"},\"header_title\":\"2026 Midterms: Congress Balance of Power?\",\"employment_collection_required\":false,\"exchange_shard\":0},\"KXCOMPANYACTIONMERGER-27\":{\"id\":\"661ba714-7dfd-4da5-af52-f94c96b95c3e\",\"ticker\":\"KXCOMPANYACTIONMERGER-27\",\"series_ticker\":\"KXCOMPANYACTIONMERGER\",\"target_datetime\":\"2027-06-01T14:00:00Z\",\"mutually_exclusive\":false,\"collateral_return_type\":\"\",\"title\":\"When will Tesla and SpaceX merge?\",\"category\":\"Financials\",\"tags\":null,\"keywords\":null,\"min_tick_size\":\"\",\"settle_details\":\"The announcement must be made through official company channels including press releases, SEC filings (8-K, 10-K, 10-Q), earnings calls, investor presentations, verified social media accounts, or official statements to media subsequently confirmed by the company. CEO statements through official channels qualify. Rumors, speculation, unconfirmed reports, leaked information, third-party announcements without company confirmation, and preliminary discussions do not qualify. The announcement must occur after market issuance. Companies are tracked through rebranding and name changes representing the same business entity.\\n\\nThis market resolves Yes regardless of which entity is the acquirer and which is the target. A Tesla acquisition of SpaceX, a SpaceX acquisition of Tesla, a reverse merger, or a stock-for-stock combination all satisfy the Payout Criterion equally, provided a definitive agreement is publicly announced.\\n\\nA statement by Elon Musk shall only satisfy the Payout Criterion if it constitutes an unambiguous, affirmative confirmation of a definitive signed agreement \u2014 not an expression of intent, a hypothetical, a negotiation update, or a speculative comment about a future combination.\",\"settlement_sources\":[{\"url\":\"http://www.sec.gov/\",\"name\":\"the Securities and Exchange Commission EDGAR database\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.foxbusiness.com/\",\"name\":\"Fox Business\"},{\"url\":\"https://abcnews.go.com/\",\"name\":\"ABC\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/\",\"name\":\"CNBC\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.wsj.com/\",\"name\":\"The Wall Street Journal\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.msnbc.com\",\"name\":\"MSNBC\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.ft.com/\",\"name\":\"Financial Times\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.theinformation.com/\",\"name\":\"The Information\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.nbcnews.com/\",\"name\":\"NBC\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/\",\"name\":\"The Washington Post\"},{\"url\":\"https://kalshi.com/\",\"name\":\"company\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.nytimes.com/\",\"name\":\"The New York Times\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.marketwatch.com/\",\"name\":\"MarketWatch\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.axios.com/\",\"name\":\"Axios\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.reuters.com/\",\"name\":\"Reuters\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.cnn.com\",\"name\":\"CNN\"},{\"url\":\"https://apnews.com/\",\"name\":\"the Associated Press\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/\",\"name\":\"CBS\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.politico.com/\",\"name\":\"Politico\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.tesla.com/\",\"name\":\"Tesla\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.spacex.com/\",\"name\":\"SpaceX\"}],\"description_context\":\"\",\"underlying\":\"If ||company|| officially announces ||action|| before ||date||, then the market resolves to Yes.\",\"metrics_tags\":null,\"mini_title\":\"When will Tesla and SpaceX merge?\",\"sub_title\":\"Corporate announcement\",\"markets\":[],\"max_close_ts\":\"2028-01-01T04:59:00Z\",\"min_open_ts\":\"2026-03-26T00:00:00Z\",\"product_metadata\":{\"competition\":\"Tesla\",\"competition_scope\":\"Merger\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{\"competition\":\"Tesla\"},\"header_title\":\"When will Tesla and SpaceX merge?\",\"employment_collection_required\":false,\"exchange_shard\":0},\"KXFEDDECISION-26DEC\":{\"id\":\"84c9d809-5800-4273-8378-e317f03c0669\",\"ticker\":\"KXFEDDECISION-26DEC\",\"series_ticker\":\"KXFEDDECISION\",\"target_datetime\":\"2026-12-10T00:00:00Z\",\"strike_date\":\"2026-12-09T19:00:00Z\",\"mutually_exclusive\":true,\"mutually_exclusive_side\":\"yes\",\"collateral_return_type\":\"MECNET\",\"title\":\"Fed decision in Dec 2026?\",\"category\":\"Economics\",\"tags\":null,\"keywords\":null,\"min_tick_size\":\"\",\"settle_details\":\"The outcomes are mutually exclusive: at most one can resolve to Yes. For example, a 50-basis-point hike resolves \u201cHike \\u003e25 bps\u201d to Yes and \u201cHike 25 bps\u201d to No.\\n\\nIf the scheduled FOMC meeting is canceled and does not occur on its scheduled date, \u201cFed maintains rate\u201d resolves to Yes and all other outcomes resolve to No.\",\"settlement_sources\":[{\"url\":\"https://www.federalreserve.gov\",\"name\":\"Federal Reserve\"}],\"description_context\":\"\",\"underlying\":\"If the Federal Reserve does a || Hike or Cut || of || Count || on || Meeting ||, then the market resolves to Yes.\",\"metrics_tags\":null,\"mini_title\":\"Fed decision in Dec 2026?\",\"sub_title\":\"On Dec 9, 2026\",\"markets\":[],\"max_close_ts\":\"2026-12-09T18:59:00Z\",\"min_o