"prediction\",\"title\":\"Florida Governor winner?\",\"about\":\"Florida's governor's race has tightened to a 2-point margin, with Republican Byron Donalds narrowly leading Democrat David Jolly in the latest University of North Florida poll, according to NBC Miami. Florida has not elected a Democratic governor since 1994.\",\"bg_image\":\"https://kalshi-fallback-images.s3.amazonaws.com/categories%2Felections%2Fmentions%202.webp\",\"bg_image_wide\":\"https://kalshi-fallback-images.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/test/byron-donalds-650-530.jpg\",\"bg_image_wide_gradient\":\"\",\"bg_color\":\"\",\"card_image\":\"https://kalshi-fallback-images.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/test/byron-donalds-450-180+copy.jpg\",\"card\":{\"type\":\"contract\",\"series_ticker\":\"GOVPARTYFL\",\"series_title\":\"Florida Governor\",\"event_ticker\":\"GOVPARTYFL-26\",\"event_subtitle\":\"In 2026\",\"event_title\":\"Florida Governor winner?\",\"total_series_volume\":9635206,\"total_event_volume\":9635206,\"recent_event_volume\":1027933,\"category\":\"Elections\",\"milestone_id\":\"5bfd0f9b-d316-5eab-9357-e4defe765d5d\",\"markets\":[{\"title\":\"Byron Donalds\",\"yes_bid\":61,\"yes_ask\":62,\"ticker\":\"GOVPARTYFL-26-R\",\"image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/market-images/GOVPARTYFL-26-R.WEBP?v=256a832442\",\"image_url_light_mode\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/market-images/GOVPARTYFL-26-R.WEBP?v=256a832442\",\"image_url_dark_mode\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/market-images/GOVPARTYFL-26-R.WEBP?v=256a832442\",\"background_color\":\"#FF6A00\",\"background_color_light_mode\":\"#FF6A00\",\"background_color_dark_mode\":\"#FF9500\",\"image_scale\":100,\"price\":62,\"previous_price\":66,\"open_date\":\"2025-01-26T15:00:00Z\",\"close_date\":\"2027-11-03T15:00:00Z\",\"rank_score\":6099,\"result\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"structured_target_id\":\"9244ed4c-9dfd-45cc-8211-996dc902f315\"},{\"title\":\"David Jolly\",\"yes_bid\":38,\"yes_ask\":39,\"ticker\":\"GOVPARTYFL-26-D\",\"image_url\":\"https://assets.